Cell["Sample-and-Hold", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"1bc1d929-56fb-409f-8650-d579115855bc"],

Cell["\<\
With the \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]latch\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] option set to \
True, the \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]delay\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] component \
functions as a sample-and-hold gate, emitting the last non-empty signal when \
receiving empty input.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"155679fb-e40a-4e87-8c28-826c96d4732f"],

